        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86351, Bar Thru-Bolt Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bar Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. This ladder style pull is a wonderful choice for its contemporary look that goes well with most decors. The Bar Handle is available in several of the most popular finishes. This Bar Thru-Bolt Door Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to mount it on a wood, fiberglass, or metal door up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/bar-back-to-back-door-handle-set-emtek-btb-86351\"><b>Bar Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Bar Front Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86351-specifications.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Bar Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86351:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 15-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86352:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.<i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
